    description: "Textured palette-knife buttercream with abstract sculptural folds inspired by Kyoto clay vessels and wild meadow blossoms.",
    medium: "Palette knife impasto, organic dried lavender, edible rose crystals",
    occasion: "Modern Art Gallery Reception",
