    image: "/images/cake-7.jpg",
    description: "Sharp architectural angles softened by hand-torn wafer sails and subtle mineral textures evoking Grecian limestone.",
    medium: "Wafer paper sails, edible mineral dust, Earl Grey & bergamot curd",
    occasion: "Bespoke Design Gala",
